      "content": "Wait, really? I read online that tea tree oil is a super strong natural antiseptic so I thought it would help kill bacteria? And my grandma always used butter for burns to soothe the sting. It's just so much easier than driving to a clinic right now. Are you sure it's actually bad for it? Like, couldn't the oil just help the skin heal faster?",
